    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"being a burden\" anymore, it feels like i'm actively making their lives worse. they had so many plans, so much energy before i met them, and now they spend all their time worrying about me or dealing with my moods. if i wasn't here, they could actually breathe again. they could be happy without having to constantly manage my darkness. sometimes i think the most selfless thing i could ever do is just stop being a problem for them.",
